#!RuleTest
#test CDISC-SEND-0129.1 expect=violation domain=SE
#note "PLAN-stopped-rule-engine-fixes item 1, the sensitivity arm: SE.SESTDTC has no method at the variable level and only ONE of its two value-level entries (ETCD=SCREEN) carries one - the ETCD=TRT entry does not. Not every value is documented, so the variable is reported once, never once per record."
#library standard=sendig version=3-1-1
#define-xml CDISC-SEND-0129.1-vlm-partial-define.xml
#expectViolationCount 1
#expectViolationAt variable_name=SESTDTC
dataset SE
col STUDYID  type=Char
col USUBJID  type=Char
col ETCD     type=Char
col SESTDTC  type=Char
---
S1 | S1-001 | SCREEN | 2026-01-01
S1 | S1-001 | TRT | 2026-01-08
